      "zisu_c": "A professional skincare house born in the treatment room, ZISU’C formulates for aestheticians before formulating for the bathroom shelf. Centella and ginseng exosomes, patented peptide complexes: every reference is conceived as a protocol, and that clinical rigour is why it sits in our cabins as well as on our shelves.",
      "urang": "Urang works cold-pressed botanical oils the way a perfumer works an absolute: few ingredients, all identifiable, all justified. Distilled Damask rose, blue chamomile, centella — short, certified-natural formulas made for skin that conventional cosmetics irritate.",
